Description: The browser's 3D menus lose the separation, screen plane and device type strings (ORDER 473u round 3)
 The strings of the removed menus (the 3D Display menu, its modes, depths and screen planes, the 3D Canvas menu's depths, the
 phone and headset hints and mode names) go from the nine languages, and the Display Settings item's label is added
 in each: waterfox/browser/locales/LOCALE/browser/browser/browserContext.ftl. Applies after the 3D Display strings.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 via Claude Code
